# JotForm Compliance Dashboard — Maintenance Guide

Everything you need to understand, run, fix, or rebuild this dashboard.
Written for someone who has never seen it before.

Canonical copy. If this file and any other doc disagree, this one is right.

Setting up a staging app is covered separately in [`STAGING.md`](STAGING.md).

---

## Part 0 — What this thing is, in one paragraph

EPGS staff fill in JotForm forms at parking and valet sites. Some of those
forms are required a certain number of times per day, week or month. This app
pulls every submission from JotForm, works out how many each site *should*
have done, compares that to what they actually did, and produces a compliance
report plus an Excel export. It runs on Streamlit Community Cloud and deploys
straight from the `main` branch of this repo.

It is one Python file, `main.py`, plus a Google Sheet that holds everything
that changes.

